@prefix lzo: <https://w3id.org/lzo/ontology/> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
lzo:Farm a owl:Class; rdfs:subClassOf lzo:AgriculturalEntity .
lzo:AgriculturalZone a owl:Class; rdfs:subClassOf lzo:AgriculturalEntity .
lzo:Field a owl:Class; rdfs:subClassOf lzo:AgriculturalZone .
lzo:Pond a owl:Class; rdfs:subClassOf lzo:AgriculturalZone .
lzo:Orchard a owl:Class; rdfs:subClassOf lzo:AgriculturalZone .
lzo:CropConcept a owl:Class; rdfs:subClassOf <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
lzo:CultivationCycle a owl:Class; rdfs:subClassOf lzo:AgriculturalEntity .
lzo:crop a owl:ObjectProperty; rdfs:range lzo:CropConcept .
lzo:locatedIn a owl:ObjectProperty; rdfs:domain lzo:AgriculturalEntity; rdfs:range lzo:AgriculturalEntity .
